OL,3,AXbox caps cloud gaming at 15 hours a
OL,4,Amonth for Game Pass subscribers
OL,5,
OL,6,FXbox is introducing strict monthly time
OL,7,Flimits for Game Pass subscribers who
OL,8,Fstream games online through its cloud
OL,9,Fgaming service.
OL,11,FThe changes, which come into effect in
OL,12,FNovember, will see a subscriber to the
OL,13,F#16.99 Ultimate monthly plan able to
OL,14,Fstream games for up to 15 hours a month
OL,15,F- before having to purchase additional
OL,16,Fcloud play time.
OL,18,FXbox said the limits were due to the
OL,19,Frising cost of cloud gaming, and they
OL,20,Fwould allow the firm to "continue to
OL,21,Finvest" in the service's "reliability
OL,22,Fand performance".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
