OL,3,AXbox caps cloud gaming at 15 hours a
OL,4,Amonth for Game Pass subscribers
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile some questioned whether the
OL,7,Fservice was used by many to begin with,
OL,8,Fothers called out the additional limits
OL,9,Ffor subscribers.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
