SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788599991
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMan About the House star Richard
OL,4,AO'Sullivan dies aged 82
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Giles Cooper of the
OL,7,FRoyal Variety Charity said: "Richard
OL,8,FO'Sullivan was a master of effortless
OL,9,Fcharm and impeccable comic timing,
OL,10,Fbringing pure warmth, wit, and
OL,11,Funforgettable joy to millions of living
OL,12,Frooms as a true giant of British
OL,13,Ftelevision."
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
