OL,3,ARussell Howard 'devastated' after his
OL,4,Ababy son died shortly after birth
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis story contains content which some
OL,7,Freaders might find distressing
OL,9,FComedian Russell Howard has revealed
OL,10,Fhis baby son Felix died earlier this
OL,11,Fyear, shortly after his wife Cerys had
OL,12,Fgiven birth.
OL,14,FIn a statement, he said he and his wife
OL,15,Fhad faced "unimaginable heartache" and
OL,16,Fdescribed it as "the most devastating
OL,17,Ftime of our lives".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
